==Battleground==
*3 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Aku Gory]] spawns as the boss.
**4 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
**5 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 36.67~40 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Care should be taken to ensure the pre-basehit Aku Doges are dealt with before letting out the Aku Gory. Aku Gory is a significant threat and should warrant the use of an anti-Aku fodder unit or unit otherwise capable of damaging Aku Gory.

